  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Women Entrepreneurship Challenge</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Foster female leadership and entrepreneurship by promoting role models. An annual competition which will select inspiring female entrepreneurs from Belgian partner countries. The aim is to reward the excellence of women entrepreneurs to whom an &quot;Award&quot; will be handed out. The prize must be in kind and offer these women a lever for growth by strengthening their entrepreneurial capacities.</narrative>
